Title:  Front Desk Executive (Receptionist)
Company Name:  A well reputed Life Insurance Company
Vacancy:  1
Age:  22 to 30 years
Job Location:  Dhaka (Tejgaon)
Salary:  Negotiable
Experience:  
Receiving visitors / customers at the front desk by greeting and welcoming them courteously & appropriately and answering phones;
Maintaining visitor & customer record, keep notes and pass them to the proper authority & maintain and upkeep the reception area;
Responding calls in a professional manner & forwarding incoming phone calls/messages to related person;
Maintain & monitor meeting room & event inside office premise;
Distribute all kinds of incoming letters/goods/parcel/bills etc. & keeping record;
Receive/ disburse all kinds of incoming/outgoing letters/goods/parcel/bills from/to related courier company representatives;
Assist Admin related job as and when necessary;
Keep up-to-date with all official / business contact numbers;
Any other tasks assigned by the management.
Awesome atmosphere for knowledge sharing and learning.
